  "resources": ["ecr repository: checkout-service", "ECS cluster/service referencing checkout-service images", "AWS account 012345678901_1", "region us-east-1"],
  "timeframe": "2026-10-28T00:00:00Z/2026-10-30T20:51:36Z",
  "criteria": "1) Was v3.1.0's disappearance caused by the lifecycle policy (match CloudTrail delete event timestamp/actor to lifecycle policy expiration action, vs a manual/other delete). 2) List current lifecycle policy rules for the repo. 3) List images/tags currently in the repo and flag which ones match a lifecycle rule for upcoming/recent expiration. 4) Cross-reference those at-risk tags against ECS task definitions and running services/tasks to flag any still in active use. 5) Note the ECS service failure (image not found) as corroborating evidence."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Investigate ECR checkout-service lifecycle policy and image deletion history"}], "created_at": null}

